    "By default the app reads the chain through public nodes run by %@. They limit how often you can ask, and they can see which addresses you look up and your IP address. To use your own node or a provider such as Alchemy or Infura, enter its URL. It's stored only in this Mac's keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default the app reads the chain through public nodes run by %@. They limit how often you can ask, and they can see which addresses you look up and your IP address. To use your own node or a provider such as Alchemy or Infura, enter its URL. It's stored only in this Mac's keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认通过 %@ 的公共节点读取链上数据。公共节点会限制请求频率，也能看到你查询了哪些地址、来自哪个 IP。想用自己的节点，或者 Alchemy、Infura 这类服务，填上它的 URL。URL 只存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
