          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个码没有读全，请再扫一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The creation data doesn't produce this address. Don't use this Safe here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The creation data doesn't produce this address. Don't use this Safe here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建参数算不出这个地址。不要在这里使用这个 Safe。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The creation parameters do not match the address, so no registration code is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The creation parameters do not match the address, so no registration code is shown."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建参数和地址对不上，不显示登记码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The creation parameters only prove the owners the Safe was created with. If the owners have changed since, register it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The creation parameters only prove the owners the Safe was created with. If the owners have changed since, register it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建参数只能证明 Safe 创建时的 owner。之后如果改过 owner，要重新登记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current account still holds %@. Its key will be deleted and that balance can't be recovered. Withdraw it first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current account still holds %@. Its key will be deleted and that balance can't be recovered. Withdraw it first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前账户里还有 %@。它的私钥会被删除，这些余额就取不回了。请先转出余额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current account's key will be deleted from this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current account's key will be deleted from this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前账户的私钥会从这台 Mac 上删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is only used on this Mac, to tell your signers apart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The name is only used on this Mac, to tell your signers apart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名字只在这台 Mac 上用，用来区分你的签名器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network fee is above the submitter account's limit, so nothing was signed. Try again later, or set a different node in Settings › Advanced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network fee is above the submitter account's limit, so nothing was signed. Try again later, or set a different node in Settings › Advanced."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络费超过了提交账户的上限，所以没有签名。请稍后再试，或者在「设置 › 高级」里换一个节点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network fee is paid by the submitter account %@ (balance %@).": {
