          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signature is in canonical form"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名格式规范"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signer checks everything itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signer checks everything itself"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名器自己核对每一笔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signer decodes every request and checks it against its own rules, so even a tampered Mac can't trick it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signer decodes every request and checks it against its own rules, so even a tampered Mac can't trick it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名器自己解码每个请求，按自己的规则核对，这台 Mac 就算被篡改也骗不了它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signer registers this Safe the first time it signs for it. You can also register it now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signer registers this Safe the first time it signs for it. You can also register it now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名器第一次为这个 Safe 签名时会顺带登记它，也可以现在就登记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signer's address could not be checked on chain, so it wasn't paired. Check the network and scan again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signer's address could not be checked on chain, so it wasn't paired. Check the network and scan again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没能在链上核对这台签名器的地址，所以没有配对。请检查网络后重新扫码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signer's key only works with the faces enrolled now. If it stops working, the other owners cannot meet the threshold and this Safe can no longer sign. Add owners, or switch the signer to “Any enrolled face”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signer's key only works with the faces enrolled now. If it stops working, the other owners cannot meet the threshold and this Safe can no longer sign. Add owners, or switch the signer to “Any enrolled face”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名器的密钥只认当前录入的面容，一旦失效，剩下的 owner 不够门限，这个 Safe 会无法签名。建议增加 owner，或者在签名器上改用「任意已录入的面容」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signer's key only works with the faces enrolled now; without it the other owners still meet the threshold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signer's key only works with the faces enrolled now; without it the other owners still meet the threshold."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名器的密钥只认当前录入的面容；去掉它之后剩下的 owner 仍然够门限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The submitter account could not be opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The submitter account could not be opened."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打不开提交账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The submitter account doesn't have enough ETH for the network fee. Top it up in Settings › Submitter Account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The submitter account doesn't have enough ETH for the network fee. Top it up in Settings › Submitter Account."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交账户里的 ETH 不够付网络费。请在“设置 › 提交账户”里充值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The submitter account doesn't have enough ETH on %@. Top it up in Settings › Submitter Account, then check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The submitter account doesn't have enough ETH on %@. Top it up in Settings › Submitter Account, then check again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交账户在 %@ 上的 ETH 不够。请在「设置 › 提交账户」里充值，再重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The submitter account only executes transactions for Safes registered in this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The submitter account only executes transactions for Safes registered in this app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交账户只执行在本 App 里登记过的 Safe 的交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The submitter account only signs on Ethereum, Base and Sepolia.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The submitter account only signs on Ethereum, Base and Sepolia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交账户只在 Ethereum、Base 和 Sepolia 上签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transaction failed on chain. The network fee was still paid; nothing was created.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transaction failed on chain. The network fee was still paid; nothing was created."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易在链上失败了。网络费照样扣了，没有创建任何东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transaction hasn't been included yet. Check it on the block explorer; once it's on chain, add the Safe with Add Existing Safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transaction hasn't been included yet. Check it on the block explorer; once it's on chain, add the Safe with Add Existing Safe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易还没被打包。请在区块浏览器里查看；上链后用「添加已有 Safe」把它加进来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transaction is on chain. Waiting for Safe's transaction service to record it…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transaction is on chain. Waiting for Safe's transaction service to record it…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易已上链，正在等 Safe 交易服务记上结果…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transaction service returned data that doesn't match its fingerprint. Don't sign or execute it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transaction service returned data that doesn't match its fingerprint. Don't sign or execute it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易服务返回的数据和交易指纹对不上。不要签名或执行这笔交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transaction was executed but failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transaction was executed but failed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易已执行，但执行失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transaction was reverted on chain. The network fee was still paid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transaction was reverted on chain. The network fee was still paid."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易在链上被回滚了，网络费照样扣了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no backup and no key export: if this Mac is lost, only the gas money in this account is lost. Withdraw the balance before switching to a new account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no backup and no key export: if this Mac is lost, only the gas money in this account is lost. Withdraw the balance before switching to a new account."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交账户不做备份，也不能导出私钥：这台 Mac 丢了，损失的只是里面的少量网络费。换新账户之前请先转出余额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no contract at this address on this network. Check the address and the network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no contract at this address on this network. Check the address and the network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条网络上这个地址没有合约。请检查地址和网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party licenses": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-party licenses"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第三方许可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac creates your Safe and puts fully signed transactions on chain from its own small submitter account, which pays the network fee. It can't touch the funds in your Safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Mac creates your Safe and puts fully signed transactions on chain from its own small submitter account, which pays the network fee. It can't touch the funds in your Safe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 用自己的小额提交账户创建 Safe、把签齐的交易发上链，并付网络费。这个账户动不了 Safe 里的资产。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac prepares and submits": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Mac prepares and submits"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 负责准备和提交"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe has a transaction guard set, which this app doesn't support yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe has a transaction guard set, which this app doesn't support yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 设置了交易 guard，这个 App 暂时还不支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe has modules enabled. Modules can move funds without the signers, so it can't be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe has modules enabled. Modules can move funds without the signers, so it can't be added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 启用了 module。module 可以绕过签名人动用资产，所以不能添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe has nothing to send yet. Use Receive to move some assets in first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe has nothing to send yet. Use Receive to move some assets in first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 里还没有可以发送的资产。先用“接收”转一些进来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe ran an extra setup step when it was created. The offline signer can't check what that step did, so it can't be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe ran an extra setup step when it was created. The offline signer can't check what that step did, so it can't be added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 创建时还执行了一步额外的初始化。离线签名器没法核对这一步做了什么，所以不能添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe wasn't created with an official Safe factory and version that this app supports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe wasn't created with an official Safe factory and version that this app supports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 不是用这个 App 支持的 Safe 官方工厂和版本创建的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe's approval threshold has changed since it was created, so it can't be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe's approval threshold has changed since it was created, so it can't be added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 的批准阈值在创建后改过，所以不能添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe's creation data couldn't be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe's creation data couldn't be read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读不懂这个 Safe 的创建参数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe's fallback handler has changed since it was created, so it can't be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe's fallback handler has changed since it was created, so it can't be added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 的 fallback handler 在创建后改过，所以不能添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe's implementation contract has changed since it was created, so it can't be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe's implementation contract has changed since it was created, so it can't be added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 的实现合约在创建后改过，所以不能添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe's settings have changed since it was added: %@. These can let funds move without its signers, or change what a signature approves, and your signer can't check them offline. Don't approve transactions from this Safe until you know who changed them and why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe's settings have changed since it was added: %@. These can let funds move without its signers, or change what a signature approves, and your signer can't check them offline. Don't approve transactions from this Safe until you know who changed them and why."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 的设置在添加之后变了：%@。这些设置可以让资金不经签名人就被转走，或者改变签名批准的内容，而签名器离线核对不了。弄清楚是谁改的、为什么改之前，不要批准这个 Safe 的交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Safe's signers have changed since it was created. The offline signer can only trust the signers it was created with, so it can't be added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Safe's signers have changed since it was created. The offline signer can only trust the signers it was created with, so it can't be added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Safe 的签名人在创建后改过。离线签名器只能相信创建时的签名人，所以不能添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address has a typo: its capital letters don't match its checksum. Copy it again from the source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This address has a typo: its capital letters don't match its checksum. Copy it again from the source."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个地址有笔误：大小写和校验和对不上。请从原处重新复制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a main network: creating the Safe costs real ETH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a main network: creating the Safe costs real ETH."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是主网：创建 Safe 要花真实的 ETH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a signer's address, not a wallet: it belongs to the signing contract of a Safe signer, and anything sent to it is lost forever. It can't be saved as a recipient.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a signer's address, not a wallet: it belongs to the signing contract of a Safe signer, and anything sent to it is lost forever. It can't be saved as a recipient."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是签名人的地址，不是钱包：它属于 Safe 签名人的签名合约，转进去的任何资产都会永久丢失，所以不能存成收款人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a signer's address, not a wallet: it belongs to the signing contract of a Safe signer. Anything sent to it is lost forever, so it can't be a recipient. To pay this person, use their wallet address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a signer's address, not a wallet: it belongs to the signing contract of a Safe signer. Anything sent to it is lost forever, so it can't be a recipient. To pay this person, use their wallet address."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是签名人的地址，不是钱包：它属于 Safe 签名人的签名合约。转进去的任何资产都会永久丢失，所以不能当收款人。要给这个人转账，请用他的钱包地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the Safe itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the Safe itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Safe 自己的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the zero address. Anything sent to it is lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the zero address. Anything sent to it is lost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是零地址，转进去的资产会永久丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a valid URL. It should look like https://…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This isn't a valid URL. It should look like https://…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是有效的 URL，应该是 https://… 这样的格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't an Ethereum address. It should be 0x followed by 40 letters and digits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This isn't an Ethereum address. It should be 0x followed by 40 letters and digits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是以太坊地址。地址应该是 0x 加 40 位字母和数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This network isn't supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This network isn't supported."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持这条网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This node serves %@, not %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This node serves %@, not %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个节点是 %1$@ 的，不是 %2$@ 的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pairing code could not be read. Open the pairing page on the signer again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This pairing code could not be read. Open the pairing page on the signer again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对码格式不对，请在签名器上重新打开配对页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This signature doesn't match the transaction and won't be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This signature doesn't match the transaction and won't be used."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个签名和交易对不上，不会被使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This signature is from “%@”, but the request was sent to “%@”. It won't be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This signature is from “%@”, but the request was sent to “%@”. It won't be used."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个签名来自“%1$@”，但请求是发给“%2$@”的，不会被使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This signer uses a debug software key without Face ID protection. Use it for testing only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This signer uses a debug software key without Face ID protection. Use it for testing only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台签名器用的是调试用的软件密钥，没有 Face ID 保护，只能用于测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This signer's key only works with the faces enrolled now. If Face ID enrollment changes (including adding an alternate appearance), the key stops working for good and the other owners have to replace it. Make sure the remaining owners still meet the threshold without this signer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This signer's key only works with the faces enrolled now. If Face ID enrollment changes (including adding an alternate appearance), the key stops working for good and the other owners have to replace it. Make sure the remaining owners still meet the threshold without this signer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台签名器的密钥只认当前录入的面容：以后增删面容（包括添加「备用外貌」），这把密钥会永久失效，只能靠其他 owner 把它换掉。请确认去掉这台签名器后，剩下的 owner 仍然够门限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This transaction's number has been used on chain, but for two minutes Safe's transaction service hasn't recorded it as executed. Another transaction with the same number may have run instead. Refresh to check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This transaction's number has been used on chain, but for two minutes Safe's transaction service hasn't recorded it as executed. Another transaction with the same number may have run instead. Refresh to check again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链上已经用过这笔交易的编号，但两分钟内 Safe 交易服务都没记上它已执行，可能是同编号的另一笔交易先执行了。请刷新再看看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threshold": {
