    "“%@” disappears from this app. The Safe on chain and its funds are not affected; you can add it again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” disappears from this app. The Safe on chain and its funds are not affected; you can add it again later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”会从这个 App 里消失。链上的 Safe 和里面的资产都不受影响，以后可以再加回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has the address of a signer that is already paired, but a different key. Nothing was saved. If that signer was reset, unpair the old one first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has the address of a signer that is already paired, but a different key. Nothing was saved. If that signer was reset, unpair the old one first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的地址和一台已配对的签名器相同，公钥却不一样，没有保存。如果那台签名器重置过，请先解除旧的配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is an owner of this Safe": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is an owner of this Safe"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”是这个 Safe 的 owner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is removed from this Mac, and you can't ask it to sign from here until you pair it again. Nothing changes on the signer or in your Safes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is removed from this Mac, and you can't ask it to sign from here until you pair it again. Nothing changes on the signer or in your Safes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”会从这台 Mac 上移除，再次配对之前不能从这里让它签名。签名器和你的 Safe 都不会有任何变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✔ Matches the test data": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✔ Matches the test data"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✔ 与测试数据一致"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
